Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.86,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,In class, there are lots of\Ndifferent kinds of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:04.70,Default - Top,male student B; background,0,0,0,,Dude, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:08.86,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Those who can make others laugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:09.18,Default - Top,male student B; background,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:10.96,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,and those who make things lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:12.68,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:16.63,Default,male student A,0,0,0,,If you're gonna be a comedy duo,\Nyou gotta start with an exchange journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:18.37,Default,male student B,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:22.88,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm the person holding back laughter off\Nto the side from the people having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.38,Default - Top,male student A,0,0,0,,It's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:25.38,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It's no good. I'm going to laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:27.66,Default,male student B,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishi-san's laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:28.63,Default,male student A,0,0,0,,What? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:29.73,Default,male student A,0,0,0,,Am I odd for thinking that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.18,Default,male student A,0,0,0,,It's normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:31.85,Default,male student B,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:33.07,Default,male student A,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:35.38,Default,male student B,0,0,0,,An exchange diary wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.17,Default - Top,male student A,0,0,0,,First, you have to deepen\Nyour bond as a duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:38.52,Default - Top,male student A; background,0,0,0,,That's why you start an exchange diary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.57,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It's so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:39.57,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,The tempo of their\Nconversation is so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:41.27,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.27,0:00:43.81,Default,female student A,0,0,0,,Hey, you're putting\NNishi-san in a tough spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:44.52,Default,male student A,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:45.43,Default,male student A,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.43,0:00:47.44,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:49.92,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I killed the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.53,0:00:50.28,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7F98E&\3c&HE6982B&\fs28\an7}EEEK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.17,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,That was a shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:56.53,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Please don't suddenly bring me\Ninto the conversation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:59.16,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It isn't that I want to join in!\NI'm fine just listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.79,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,But it's creepy that I was smiling\Nbecause of what I overheard. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.23,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nisshi, you really are shy\Naround people, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:07.44,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Hon-chan, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.21,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Borrowing this book from a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:13.01,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nisshi, if only you didn't get nervous,\Nyou'd be able to talk normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:14.24,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:16.84,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,comprehending what other people\Nare saying is one step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:16.64,Basic Sign,SIGN; Nishi's head,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz32.21\pos(172,118.667)\fad(401,189)\c&HA4C439&\3c&HD6FFFC&}FULL POWER
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:19.67,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Thinking about how\Nto answer is one more step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:19.43,Basic Sign,SIGN; arch,0,0,0,,{\fs24\an8\c&H3768E1&\3c&HD9FFFC&\fad(400,185)}VISUALIZATION
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:22.92,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,And putting the things that popped\Ninto my mind into words is another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.47,0:01:22.94,Basic Sign,SIGN; above Nishi,0,0,0,,{\fad(443,275)\fs24\pos(418,87)\c&HBB5E50&\3c&HD6FFFE&}PREPARING\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWORDS...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:27.77,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Lots of thoughts appear in my head,\Nbut they never come out well in words.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:29.46,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,That hurdle is far too high for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:30.73,Italics,Honda,0,0,0,,You're super chatty now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:33.39,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,But I don't think it's something\Nyou need to worry about, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.39,0:01:36.54,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,I'd say that earlier stuff was more about\Nenthusiasm than conversation anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:38.78,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:41.25,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I get even more nervous when it's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:45.02,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Whether they're guys or girls, they bleed\Nthe same color when you stab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:46.50,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Please don't stab anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:50.75,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Oh, Hon-chan! Lately, there's a boy\NI keep thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:52.13,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,What? When? You're not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:53.38,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Who is it? Who? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.90,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, from the class next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.17,0:02:00.10,Italics,Honda,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.61,0:02:01.39,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:03.77,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,The person who has library duty with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:04.64,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:07.25,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You said he doesn't talk much, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.77,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,That's right.\NHe isn't the type to talk much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:11.36,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.30,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,There's nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:23.53,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,An unexpected sort of student has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:26.12,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:27.15,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:29.51,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,They know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:35.80,Basic Sign,SIGN; sfx,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs24\c&H772DDD&}YAY YAY YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:43.42,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,No matter how I look at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:44.83,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,those two have a strange dynamic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.28,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} why he's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:49.47,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I thought that Tani-kun was like me,\Nso it was such a shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:52.64,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Well, not talking much\Ndoesn't necessarily equal shyness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.82,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,She says impolite things so naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:55.82,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,And also!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.52,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,And he wasn't just showing that off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:59.14,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,He's also got delinquents idolizing him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.11,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Huh? Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:03.87,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,He wasn't scared of them\Nor just going along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:07.92,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,He was talking to delinquents with\Na fondly exasperated sort of attitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:08.80,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You don't say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:10.96,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,He seems like the protagonist\Nof a light novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:10.96,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fad(435,1)\fs24\an8\c&HB76309&}SIGH...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.96,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fad(435,1)\fs24\an8\c&HB76309&}NOT\NTHIS\NAGAIN...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.74,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,He made amusing, \Nperfectly timed comments,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:14.82,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,and I could barely hold my laughter in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:18.22,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,So you were listening to people\Nand grinning to yourself again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:20.58,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nisshi, what if you could just join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.58,0:03:22.21,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's not that I want to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.21,0:03:23.20,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:25.25,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,but if you can't stop thinking about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:26.48,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:27.09,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:30.85,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Like he's close to being in\Nthe position you want to be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:31.73,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.25,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Do you think that's it? That might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.47,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,I think that's probably it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.42,0:03:53.21,Basic Sign,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,115)\fnArial}YOU AND I ARE POLAR OPPOSITES
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:08.95,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,So that's what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.92,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\frz23.45\an8\fad(225,192)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H6B90DE&}WORDS\NAND\NTHOUGHTS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.92,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\fad(225,192)\pos(160,123)\frz16.09\c&H8C8284&}COMMUNICATION\NSKILLS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:12.08,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I've always thought that\NI wanted to fix my shyness,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:16.09,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,but the truth is that I wanted to be\Nincluded in that boisterous atmosphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.85,0:05:18.41,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:20.40,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,Did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:21.47,Flashback,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:22.09,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.22,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,They're listening to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:25.75,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Okay, Tani! Why don't you come\Nwith us and we'll all go to TokyoU?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:27.35,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,You're jumping way too far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:32.92,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,He noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:35.98,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do? He noticed that\NI laughed just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:40.49,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,And he's looking this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:46.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HF0F20E&\bord0}ARGHHHHH...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.91,0:05:44.26,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry that I listened\Nwithout permission and laughed! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.46,Flashback Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Please don't look at me!\NIt's scary! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:47.74,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It's totally impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.84,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I mean, for some reason,\NI'm already terrified!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:52.87,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like people will think, "What?\NWhy are you laughing? And who are you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:54.87,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,And they'd be entirely correct, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.84,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm really so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:58.72,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nisshi, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:02.02,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Nisshi, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:07.42,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,After much consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:10.34,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I think I'll refrain from aiming\Ntoo high and stick to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:11.64,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs16\frz27.85\fad(230,1)\pos(36,93.334)\c&H790054&\bord1}AND REALLY,\NYOU SHOULD LISTEN\NTO THE LECTURE.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.52,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,What made you decide that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:12.92,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Honda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.16,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh. Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:18.19,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.44,0:06:18.90,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\bord2\c&HEAB60D&\pos(231.333,36)\fad(145,105)}BOW
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:19.77,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\bord2\c&HF3ABF7&\fad(145,105)\pos(219.333,115.333)\3c&H9B6FE2&}BOW
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:20.00,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,'Lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:23.06,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,That was such a weird response!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:25.33,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Honda, we're using that book\Nnext period. Can I have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:28.12,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! I was going\Nto give it back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:28.78,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.04,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Hang on. Don't tell me that\N they know each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:35.71,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\c&HB8EA1E&\fad(141,107)\an7}STAAAAARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:37.22,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Are you collecting those?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:37.67,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:39.59,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fs16\frz13.67\pos(152.667,68)\c&H975EEC&\3c&H88F0B6&\bord2}BREAD FESTIVAL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:39.59,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs12\c&H70B721&\3c&H88F0B6&\bord2\frz15.89\fnArial\pos(283.334,254.667)}30 PTS IS GUARANTEED A PRIZE!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:43.04,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I was collecting them before, but it's\Ncrazy hard to meet the requirements!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.01,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Every day, bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:44.01,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HBAFFFD&\3c&H6F1578&\shad1\4c&H6F1578&\pos(461.334,61.334)\fad(104,1)}EVERY DAY,\NBREAD
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.26,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,That's... true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.62,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,What did you try for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:48.39,Default,Yamda,0,0,0,,The yeti cushion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.39,0:06:49.35,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,It wouldn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.18,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.62,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:52.95,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,This is funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:53.61,Default - Top,Honda,0,0,0,,Then, Yamada, do you have\Nyetis in your room right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:54.32,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:57.35,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\fad(1,100)\pos(404,54)\c&HCEFFF7&\3c&H8BAF44&\bord1}GASP
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz320.8\an4\pos(97,25)\c&H672F0C&\3c&HB6FF98&\fad(150,1)}AAAAAAAA...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.98,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for laughing\Nat someone else's taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,There's a huge dragonfly loose\Nin our classroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:04.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Capture it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.85,0:07:05.86,Default - Top,Yamada,0,0,0,,Who summons someone\Nfor something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:07.86,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:09.54,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:10.96,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:14.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Here. Take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.98,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,If you feel sorry, then don't summon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, that girl\Nyou were with just now sure is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:20.38,Default,Yamda,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:28.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,She's just like a doll! I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:29.23,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:30.70,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,She's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:34.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh! Guys who can honestly\Nadmit stuff like that are popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.28,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,For real? Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Keep it up and catch that dragonfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.57,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Are you trying to cheer me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:41.78,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Huh? When you mentioned delinquents,\Nyou were talking about Yamada?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.78,0:07:44.98,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,We were in the same class last year\Nand he's not a hoodlum or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:47.03,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What, really? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.84,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,You wouldn't ask some thug to\Ncatch a bug at school, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.20,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.81,0:07:51.33,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.04,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.27,0:07:56.15,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,His name is Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:57.47,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Hup. Heave...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:01.89,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Yamada's self-analysis is lacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:04.00,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,so we bring it to you\Nthrough yeti interpretation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:07.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; banner,0,0,0,,{\fs28\c&H343F56&\3c&H9BECFD&}IN ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:07.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; right; left,0,0,0,,{\bord1\c&H8032EB&\fs24\an7}YAY YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.00,0:08:07.01,Basic Sign,SIGN; right; left,0,0,0,,{\bord1\c&H8032EB&\fs24\an9}YAY YAY
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.45,Default - Top,Yeti,0,0,0,,He's always had a certain trait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:08.27,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:09.09,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.26,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H35297C&\fs24\pos(320,265)}YAMADA (AGE 9)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:14.03,Flashback,female elementary schooler A,0,0,0,,Honestly, the boys are so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:16.21,Flashback,female elementary schooler A,0,0,0,,The teacher will be here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:25.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H91FFFE&\3c&H383624&\pos(378,108)\fad(183,1)}ZIIIIING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:25.07,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,He's incredibly drawn to the laugh of\N someone he wouldn't expect to laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.57,Basic Sign,SIGN; ribbon,0,0,0,,{\c&H8D830A&\3c&HDCFFCA&\fs24\frz27.33\pos(439.333,153.334)}IN\NMIDDLE\NSCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.57,Basic Sign,SIGN; left; sfx,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HA7FBFB&\3c&H095CDD&\4c&H095CDD&\fnTrebuchet MS\shad2\bord2\frz9.649\move(132,78,172,104)}HA\NHA\NHA
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:32.07,Basic Sign,SIGN; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&H0F70E8&\fs24\3c&HB1FFFE&\bord2\an7\pos(485,15)}ATHLETIC
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:32.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H075E97&\fs24\3c&HB1FFFE&\bord2\pos(348.667,67.667)}NOISY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:32.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HAD9423&\fs24\3c&HFDFFC3&\bord2\pos(251,290)}BOOKISH
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:32.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H86B91F&\fs24\3c&HC4FFDD&\bord2\pos(366.666,267.666)}QUIET
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.44,0:08:32.07,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,The further away the person's\Ncharacter is from his own...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:36.00,Flashback,Yamada's friend,0,0,0,,Cut it out! Stop it, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:39.41,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,{\an3}She laughed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:43.13,Basic Sign,SIGN; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&HAD9423&\fs24\3c&HFDFFC3&\bord2\pos(261.237,80.713)}BOOKISH {\c&H86B91F&\fs24\3c&HC4FFDD&\bord2\pos(262.666,86.999)}QUIET
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:43.13,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H075E97&\fs24\3c&HB1FFFE&\bord2\pos(327.714,292.524)}NOISY {\c&H0F70E8&\fs24\3c&HB1FFFE&\bord2\pos(342,353.667)}ATHLETIC
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:43.13,Basic Sign,SIGN; center top,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H6EC555&\fs24\3c&HB8FFEB&\bord2\pos(278.762,172.714)}SENSE OF HUMOR
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:43.13,Basic Sign,SIGN; center bottom,0,0,0,,{\an6\c&H754899&\fs16\3c&HDFCDF9&\bord2\pos(269.809,240.904)}"THIS IS FUN!"\N"THIS IS FUNNY!"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.41,0:08:43.94,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,...the happier he gets when he sees \Ntheir hearts have something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.13,0:08:47.13,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H7545AB&\fs24\bord1\an7}DAAAAAZED...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:47.13,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,He becomes incredibly obsessed\Nand keeps thinking about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:51.13,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\c&H8EFFFF&\3c&H9B25F4&\4c&H9B25F4&\bord1\shad2\fnTrebuchet MS\an7}TRA LA LA
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:51.13,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&HDCB9F9&\3c&HDF1FBE&\4c&HDF1FBE&\bord1\shad2\fnTrebuchet MS\an3}TRA LA LA
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.80,0:08:51.13,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,However, he himself\N isn't really aware of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:52.64,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H626B50&\bord2\pos(330.667,102.667)}LIBRARY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:52.14,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,At the library...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.14,0:08:53.70,Flashback,Tani,0,0,0,,You're jumping way too far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.12,Flashback,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You sound like a crappy customer\Nasking when his shift is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:08:59.89,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,In the classroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:04.56,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,And by that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:07.50,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:09.60,Flashback,Yamada,0,0,0,,She's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:11.66,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,Though he doesn't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:14.07,Default,Yeti,0,0,0,,he has already reached the state\Nwhere he thinks she's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:16.06,Default - Top,Yamda,0,0,0,,Hey, Honda, did you watch that movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:17.58,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:17.40,Default - Top,Honda; background,0,0,0,,What movie are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:19.67,Default - Top,Yamada; background,0,0,0,,You know. The one with the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:21.08,Default - Top,Honda; background,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.08,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,But for some reason, he's been\Ncoming to our classroom a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:22.65,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.08,Default - Top,Honda; background,0,0,0,,It was wild, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:25.06,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:25.06,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:27.84,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H065FEC&\an8\bord1}HA HA HA
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.62,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,The conversation's so lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.66,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Hon-chan looks like\Nshe's having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:30.22,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san, what music do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:34.88,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I-I don't know much about music.\NUm, I think I only listen to old songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:36.35,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,But I'm not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:37.62,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:39.97,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I can't expand the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:45.48,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H96FF14&\an8\bord1\3c&H000000&\pos(439.333,2)}AAAAAAAAA...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.21,0:09:43.42,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Yamada-kun, I know you're being\Nconsiderate by trying to include me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:46.06,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,but it just highlights my\Nterrible conversational skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.48,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,It's painful for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.89,0:09:51.99,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,It's all right. Nisshi, you can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:53.74,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H259DF0&\fs24\pos(104,77)\frz38}HAPPY
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:55.24,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H3927EA&\fs24\pos(136.667,38.333)\frz30.88}ANGRY
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:54.93,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Yamada basically has no hidden side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:56.99,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF76C35&\fs24\frz326.3\pos(542.667,38.334)}SAD
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:57.33,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Nisshi, he's the perfect\Npractice partner for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:58.49,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H4EC733&\fs24\frz327.3\pos(566,79)}FUN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.41,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,That aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:00.75,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Yamada, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.05,0:10:03.67,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,it's way too obvious\Nthat you're after Nisshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:06.77,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Since you don't know each other,\Nit'd be weird to suddenly talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:08.88,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,so you decided to stick me\Nin the middle first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:11.16,Italics - Top,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,The fact that it's so easy\Nto see makes it hilarious,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:12.66,Italics - Top,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,but I'm being nice\Nby not noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:14.48,Italics - Top,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Put yourself in my shoes, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:14.88,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs12\b0\pos(321.334,346)\bord4}* SHE HAS SUCKED HER LIPS ENTIRELY\NINSIDE HER MOUTH TO KEEP FROM GRINNING.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.44,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san, you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:17.41,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:18.51,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.51,0:10:20.27,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,And stop doing that\Nevery time you come here.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.27,0:10:22.74,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Just because you have too little\Ninfo on what Nisshi likes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.74,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,{\an3}doesn't mean you should bring\Nbread stickers all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:23.77,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\pos(186.666,63.333)}NISHI-SAN\NLIKES BREAD
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.77,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\pos(186,68)}NISHI-SAN IS\NCOLLECTING\NBREAD STICKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.77,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\pos(292.666,237.999)}NISHI-SAN, YOU\NCAN HAVE THIS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.77,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\bord2\pos(154,73.333)}TH-THANK YOU
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:27.58,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,{\an3}If I say "this is good" just once,\Nmy grandpa will think it's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:30.40,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,{\an3}He'll buy it for me every time!\NYou're being just like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:30.40,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\c&H9E6D40&\fs24\pos(228.667,45.333)}YAMADA
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:30.40,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\c&H9E6D40&\fs24\pos(237.333,210.667)}HONDA'S\NGRANDPA
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.10,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,See? Just look at Nisshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:33.10,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:35.11,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,I mean, the ones with the stickers\Non them are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:38.77,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,And even if I can't collect enough\Nin time, I don't really mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.77,0:10:39.90,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,But I can't tell him that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.90,0:10:41.41,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,That's what her face is saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:42.83,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:43.60,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.42,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,You sure get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.99,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,It's fun listening to the two of you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.67,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\an1\pos(365,129)\c&H7602B8&\bord1\fad(390,1)	}JUST LISTENING\NIS FUN...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:50.67,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,Nisshi, you have it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:50.67,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HA9F2ED&\3c&H9AA869&\fs24\fad(480,1)\bord2\an4}NOTICE ALREADY...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:54.84,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,But it'll probably take some time\Nfor them to start being friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:11:00.15,Default,principal,0,0,0,,Well now... you will have a lot\Nof time during summer vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:04.18,Default,principal,0,0,0,,but when you let down your guard,\Ntime disappears before you even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:07.91,Default,principal,0,0,0,,So, take this opportunity to do\Nthings you wouldn't normally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:12.15,Default,principal,0,0,0,,Use your time in a meaningful way and\Nenjoy yourself to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.15,0:11:14.65,Default,principal,0,0,0,,Summer vacation is, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:16.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That talk was so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:24.87,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H1A94E9&\bord1\an9\fad(1,145)\pos(584,15.333)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:24.87,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1\an7\c&H9C3CD9&\fad(1,145)\pos(75.333,-1.333)}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:19.90,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,He definitely could've condensed\Nthat speech. Right, Tani?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:22.19,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,He repeated the same points several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:24.75,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Tani, you really say what\Nyou mean, huh? That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:30.17,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord1\an8\fad(184,940)\pos(128.667,2.667)\c&H9D3BDA&}YAY {\c&H1A94E9&}YAY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:28.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,In our hearts, it feels like it's\Nalready summer vacation, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.17,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Suzuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:32.66,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You have someone, but will you\Nstill hang with us over break?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:34.05,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? Of course I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Where will we go? What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:35.80,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Hey, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:40.50,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,When you want to get\Nsomeone's contact info...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.50,0:11:41.68,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,how do you ask them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.60,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What? What's this? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:48.30,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Hold on. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.30,0:11:50.94,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I love bittersweet stories like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:53.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yamada, has spring come for you?\NEven though it's summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:54.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'll totally cheer you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:57.13,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, if it was me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:11:59.78,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'd gauge the mood and take\Na photo in the chaos...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:02.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,then say, "I'll send you the photo later,\Nso tell me your contact info!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.39,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Did she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:05.70,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Don't pretend to be asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.98,0:12:08.95,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,"Suzuki-san, back then,\Ndid you already..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:12.59,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Don't dub me without consent\Nand then get angry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:15.59,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,What about using an invite\Nto a game or app as a pretext?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:24.10,Basic Sign,SIGN; top to bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnArial\b0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1\pos(266,79.334)}〇〇 MIDDLE SCHOOL 3-〇 GROUP (2)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:15.88,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnArial\b0\3c&HA88860&\pos(312.667,152.667)\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(1,62)}▢▢▢ HAS LEFT THE GROUP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.01,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnArial\b0\3c&HA88860&\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(318,250.667)\fad(1,62)}XXX HAS LEFT THE GROUP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:18.76,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnArial\b0\3c&HA88860&\bord1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(325.333,176)\fad(228,106)}△△△ HAS LEFT THE GROUP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:18.61,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,I type messages into a\Nchat room with no one in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:20.54,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Then why do the messages come to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:22.42,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Since it's you, Taira, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:24.10,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,So, I don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.30,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:30.10,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,if you're not close, wouldn't it be scary\Nto suddenly be asked for contact info?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:31.15,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord2\c&H8000D8&\3c&H5B007C&\an8\pos(212,20)}SERIOUSLY, YOU...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:33.62,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,But, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:35.90,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,if a stranger is into you\Nwithout you knowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:38.66,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,and you don't know why,\Nthat's terrifying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:40.94,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,Doesn't it make you wonder what they see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.40,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,It's just too hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:45.37,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,You should have more confidence\Nin who you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.65,0:12:49.68,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,It just... doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.68,0:12:53.88,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm in love\Nwith this person or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:57.38,Basic Sign,SIGN; right,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HE3CD11&\bord1\fad(478,1)}REALLY...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:57.38,Basic Sign,SIGN; left,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HE3CD11&\bord1\c&HF4FFB9&\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&HE4D010&\4c&HE4D010&\shad2\fad(478,1)} HUH?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:57.15,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't know anything about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:13:01.34,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,But I want to know more, so...\NHow do I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:08.20,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I might be headed toward\Nfalling in love right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:14.82,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Full steam ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.58,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Just keep heading that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:17.47,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,I feel much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:19.86,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,What? What? What are we so excited about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.86,0:13:21.50,Italics,Taira,0,0,0,,It's all so blindingly brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.50,0:13:22.54,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:26.20,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,All right! Summer vacation! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:30.11,Default,Honda,0,0,0,,Hey, Nisshi. During summer vacation,\Nthere's a collab cafe for my bias and—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:33.71,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,I knew you would come... Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:39.46,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HA80B8C&\bord2}STAAAARE...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:34.92,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,You can do this, Yamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.47,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,It's the last day of first term.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:39.46,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,What roundabout method\Nwill you employ today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:42.08,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.47,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Nishi-san, I'd like to get\Nalong better with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:46.25,Default,Nishi; Honda,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:49.17,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,But it's already the start of\Nsummer vacation...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.75,0:13:52.07,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,so will you be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:02.78,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.50,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What?! Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:08.16,Italics,Honda; internal,0,0,0,,A sudden fastball?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:09.81,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:12.83,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:15.87,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,Instead of making\Neye contact and talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:19.00,Italics,Nishi; internal,0,0,0,,writing back and forth\Nmight make me less nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:22.42,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Um, then... I'd be happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.01,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:28.70,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,I, um, I'm not good at sophisticated\Nreplies or amusing quips.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:31.60,Default,Yamada,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like we're becoming\Na comedy team, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:34.59,Default,Nishi,0,0,0,,Th-That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.01,0:14:42.19,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,But, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:45.80,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,the moment you realize\Nyou're headed toward falling in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.44,Default,Taira,0,0,0,,you're already in love, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:50.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wonder what the definition\Nof "love" really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:51.24,Default,Watanabe,0,0,0,,Huh? Philosophy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.14,Default,Azuma,0,0,0,,Tani, where did your love start?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:54.58,Default,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh, I was wondering that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:55.85,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:58.96,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs12\c&H70B721&\3c&H88F0B6&\bord2\fnArial\frz46.75\pos(343.334,206.001)}30 PTS IS GUARANTEED A PRIZE!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:16.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Have I had a little too much fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:19.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hello? Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:20.59,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Is now okay to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:21.94,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.73,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Do you have time tomorrow?\NWant to work on our homework together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:28.36,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sure, but why are you whispering?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:34.87,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs20\c&H6A9C40&\bord1\pos(212,235)}OLDER BROTHER'S ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:31.59,Default - Top,Suzuki's brother; background,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:33.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,my brother's in the room\Nnext to mine right now, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.69,0:15:37.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I don't want him\Nto know about my love life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.87,0:15:37.12,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H6A9C40&\bord1\pos(212,235)}BUT SHE WANTS TO\NTALK ON THE PHONE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:40.07,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So, tomorrow, let's meet at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:40.82,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:41.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Then, I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:43.42,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:47.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:15:55.80,Default,Tani's mom,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:57.16,Default,Tani's mom,0,0,0,,Do you have cram school today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:57.64,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:00.64,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm going to the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:01.64,Default,Tani's mom,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:03.98,Default,Tani's mom,0,0,0,,Take the key with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:06.07,Default - Top,Tani's mom,0,0,0,,No one will be home later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:07.15,Basic Sign,SIGN; top bubble; top,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H9BFFFF&\3c&H7AB360&\bord1\pos(339.333,56)}FATHER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:07.15,Basic Sign,SIGN; top bubble; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&H7AB360&\bord1\pos(329.333,178.666)\3c&HB4FF95&}GOLF
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:07.15,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom bubble; top,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&HAB5F7C&\bord1\c&HADFEFB&\pos(337.333,196)}GRANDMA
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:07.15,Basic Sign,SIGN; bottom bubble; bottom,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCF446F&\bord1\3c&HD8BFF3&\pos(338,333.999)}GRAND GOLF
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.47,Default - Top,Tani,0,0,0,,Okay. I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.09,0:16:12.65,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,"I'm going to the library."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:15.95,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:19.70,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:26.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I was planning to get here first\Nand snag us seats,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:28.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,but we arrived at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:29.99,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't\Nhave to do all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:31.42,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fnArial\c&HFFFFFF&\bord0\pos(342.667,148.667)}KONEKO-MACHI LIBRARY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:36.32,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:38.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.19,0:16:42.69,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HC2BCBA&\fnArial\fs20\move(330,80,330,49)}KONEKO-MACHI COMMUNITY CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:43.53,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What do we do? There weren't\Nany open seats anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.53,0:16:45.17,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And I don't know about waiting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:47.80,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Should we look for a cafe\Nthat'll let us hang out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:51.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Was there one around here?\NI'm gonna check the map, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.79,0:16:54.45,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ugh. There's nothing around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:16:59.47,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:01.55,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Want to come to my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:07.00,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?! You don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:07.83,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\pos(176.667,96.667)}THUD THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.00,0:17:07.83,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.56,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,It's not very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.59,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,And it's better than finding\Na shop in this heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:12.88,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,His house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.12,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,His house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:14.51,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFC665D&\b0\bord2\fs24\pos(148.667,152.667)\fade(647,644)}TANI
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.09,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Does that mean his family, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.09,Basic Sign,SIGN; man,0,0,0,,{\fade(690,1)\b0\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\fs24\pos(111.333,112.667)}FATHER
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.09,Basic Sign,SIGN; woman,0,0,0,,{\fade(690,1)\b0\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\fs24\pos(156,170.667)}MOTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:20.72,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There's no one home right now anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:22.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H8E0065&\pos(452,58)}WHAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:23.54,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Since there's no one home,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:26.36,Italics,Tani; internal,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san won't feel like she has\Nto be considerate of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\fad(266,1)\pos(520,175.334)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\fad(266,1)\pos(474,62)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.23,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\fad(266,1)\pos(150.667,146.667)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:27.74,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:29.00,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:33.19,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\pos(64,35)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:33.19,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\pos(566.667,181.667)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:33.19,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\pos(574,31)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.23,0:17:33.19,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HAA3EEB&\fs24\pos(58.667,197)}THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:31.78,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,There's no one home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.74,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H17FFB8&\3c&HA600A3&\fs16\bord2\frz24.09\pos(368,67.334)\fad(477,191)}"THERE'S NO\NONE HOME\NRIGHT NOW."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:32.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&H17FFB8&\3c&HA600A3&\fs16\bord2\frz24.09\fad(477,191)\pos(251.333,91.334)}"THERE'S NO\NONE HOME\NRIGHT NOW."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:32.67,Italics,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:36.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Please, lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:42.95,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs16\bord1\c&H5C049C&\3c&HEEB8F9&\frz342.7\pos(434,272)}* DINING ROOM\N* STUDYING SERIOUSLY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:41.90,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:45.96,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:56.97,Italics,Suzuki; Tani; internal,0,0,0,,this feels so comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.05,0:17:59.22,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF9F8AA&\3c&HBE6A44&\bord2\shad2\4c&HBE6A44&\an8\fad(1235,1)}GROWL...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:00.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.33,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Should we have lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.83,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:03.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF9F8AA&\3c&HBE6A44&\bord1\shad1\4c&HBE6A44&\fad(1229,440)\pos(111.333,77.333)}GROWL
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:12.98,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hey, Tani-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:15.86,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you the type to tell your family\Nthat you're dating someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:21.41,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I haven't told them. I don't usually\Ntell them much about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.12,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's so like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.24,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Why ask that all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:28.50,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I was just wondering if it's okay for me\Nto be here, even though it's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:30.47,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I'm the one who brought you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:32.67,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, you don't\Nhave to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.77,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,If you'd prefer,\NI'll tell them everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:40.91,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,No, no! You don't have to follow\Nmy norms for stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:44.23,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And every family has\Nits own boundaries anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:45.14,Basic Sign,SIGN; right to left,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\frz334.8\pos(509.333,70.667)\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H9A51D4&}MOTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:45.14,Basic Sign,SIGN; arrow,0,0,0,,{\c&H9A51D4&\fs16\bord2\frz329.8\pos(517.334,280.667)}COULD PROBABLY\NTELL HER...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:45.14,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\frz6.642\pos(310.666,46)\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HD3D271&}FATHER
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:45.14,Basic Sign,SIGN; arrow,0,0,0,,{\c&HD3D271&\fs16\bord2\frz357.4\pos(383.334,200)}HMMM...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:45.14,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs20\pos(135.333,78.667)\frz22.96\bord2\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H9B877C&}BROTHER
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:45.14,Basic Sign,SIGN; arrow,0,0,0,,{\c&H9B877C&\fs16\bord2\frz24.56\pos(273.334,174.666)}DEFINITE NO
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:47.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Let's go at a pace that\Nwon't stress us out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.77,0:18:48.63,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:52.55,Default,Suzuki; Tani,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:52.90,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\an7\c&H9FFFFF&\3c&H4496B7&\bord2\fad(231,1)}THANK YOU\NFOR THE MEAL
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:55.90,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we resume our studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:18:56.89,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I forgot a textbook. I'll go and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:00.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Huh? Where? At school?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.65,0:19:01.96,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,No. In my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:04.16,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Is that all? That's fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.49,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\pos(544.667,126)\c&HCCFFFD&\3c&HA0B275&\bord2\fad(400,971)}"HIS ROOM"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.17,Italics,Suzuki; internal,0,0,0,,His room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:18.61,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,There's nothing here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:24.02,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This room's so stoic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:26.58,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You like Pokomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.93,0:19:28.68,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HF5EFC2&\3c&HD29A64&\bord2\move(528,58,509,58)}DESK\NMAT
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:29.19,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,I used it a fair amount in\Nelementary school, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:32.69,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,That's so you, Tani-kun!\NYou take good care of your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:35.21,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,This is one of those ones\Nthat's kind to your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:37.16,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,My grandma said they're\Ncheaper as a set,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.25,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,so she gave me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:39.44,Basic Sign,SIGN; top,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\c&HD17945&\bord1\fs16\frz19.56\pos(82,40.667)}SHOCK ABSORBING
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:39.44,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\c&HFFFFFF&\bord1\shad2\fs16\frz19.56\3c&H7536CA&\4c&H7536CA&\pos(138,152)}DISCOUNTED SET
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It so works!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.81,0:19:41.73,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,So, you live with your grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:42.20,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:44.27,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:46.40,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,You don't have any yearbooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:48.10,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Without conversational context?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:48.95,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\fnArial\\fs12\an8\frz9.592\pos(134,92)}SHE COULDN'T FIND A MORE\NNATURAL WAY TO BRING IT UP
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:52.71,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H0E4A67&\bord1\3c&H241341&\frz22.38\move(460,246,460,232)}GRADUATION
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:52.30,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,T-Tani-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:53.99,Default - Top,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Your glasses are different!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:55.46,Basic Sign,SIGN; by finger,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b0\fs12\bord1\frz343.1\pos(216.666,351.333)\fad(151,1)}TANI
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:55.46,Default - Top,Tani,0,0,0,,Is it really that surprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:57.74,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tani-kun, your middle school\Nhad a uniform with a high collar,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:59.99,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,so it's pretty much the same as\Nyour current one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:02.09,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I wish I could see you in a blazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:02.72,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:05.65,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yeah. I want to see lots of things,\Nand I want to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.19,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:12.76,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:22.07,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Oh, you're adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:22.07,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord2\an9\fnTrebuchet MS\c&HDDB1F5&\3c&H8B2B7F&}OHHHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:22.07,Basic Sign,SIGN; lower,0,0,0,,{\fs24\bord2\c&HA95AF5&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(399,127)\fad(811,1)}ADOOOOOORABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:23.29,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Pleasure to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:26.41,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I've been granted the\Nhonor of dating Tani-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:28.01,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,My name is Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:29.83,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:33.96,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I should\Nformally greet your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:35.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:40.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Ugh, you're just so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:43.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:45.44,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Tempura-chan, I'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.37,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:52.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's nice that you have a garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:53.55,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:54.68,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Be careful where you step.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.68,0:20:55.35,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:56.60,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.36,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:03.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:13.35,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,Oh my, oh my, oh my. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:16.46,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\3c&H7C1658&\4c&H7C1658&\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\shad2\frz10.84\pos(528.666,44.666)\fad(859,1)}GRIN...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.35,0:21:15.91,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,Oh, how naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:16.57,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:17.75,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It isn't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:21.88,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you!\NI attend the same school as Tani-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:24.14,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,We're in the same class.\NMy name is Suzuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:25.39,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:27.51,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(397,1)\fs24\c&HD48E55&\bord1\an8\3c&HADFFCB&}"FRIEND"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:27.51,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(518,1)\fs24\c&HC54EDC&\bord1\pos(290.666,145.333)\3c&HDFC2F7&}"GIRLFRIEND"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:30.51,Default,Tani,0,0,0,,She's my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:38.11,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,Suzuki-san, do you like vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.64,0:21:40.87,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Yes! I like most foods!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.87,0:21:43.03,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,Wait here a moment, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.03,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,I like growing vegetables...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:51.45,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,But I just can't use them up fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.45,0:21:53.70,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,If you'd like, you can\Ntake some home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:55.04,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.04,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\fs24\c&HADFEFB&\bord2\shad1\3c&H9127B3&\4c&H9127B3&\pos(71.333,68)\frz18.07}SO VERY
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:58.04,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fnTrebuchet MS\an9\bord2\c&H9700B5&}AVANT-GARDE...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.55,0:21:58.04,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,They're odd shapes,\Nbut they are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.04,0:21:59.71,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.55,Default,Tani's grandma,0,0,0,,Come and visit again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.79,0:22:08.34,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:09.76,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.48,0:22:10.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\move(70,130,216,130)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:11.43,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\move(-7,86,75,86)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:11.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\move(312,132,347,132)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.98,0:22:12.44,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\move(115,86,121,86)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.44,0:22:12.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(355,131)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:13.44,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(121,86)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:13.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(355,131)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:14.44,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(121,86)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.44,0:22:14.98,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(355,131)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:15.44,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(121,86)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:15.73,Basic Sign,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs24\c&HCCF7FE&\bord2\3c&H9232D4&\shad2\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(355,131)}FIDGET
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:14.66,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Mom, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.72,0:22:17.48,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,someone gave me a bunch of veggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:18.18,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:19.38,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:23.13,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,You have a boyfriend?\NWhen did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:25.61,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,Please don't tell Dad or my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.61,0:22:26.81,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,I won't. I won't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.81,0:22:28.12,Default,Suzuki's mom,0,0,0,,Bring him by sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:29.33,Default,Suzuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.12,0:22:34.98,Default - Top,Tani's mom,0,0,0,,Mom, you're in a good mood today.
